    dcterms:description "AI-augmented yield optimization engine that synthesizes nutrient cycle quality, IPM pest pressure, and harvest readiness signals across the entire agricultural deployment. Implements corrective strategies: when nutrient lockout co-occurs with pest pressure, triggers emergency intervention; when harvest approaches with clear IPM status, optimizes the final push for peak yield; monitors recovery trajectories to forecast adjusted harvest windows. Reads outputs from AgNutrientCycleOptimizer [3959:3963], AgIPMPestAlertMonitor [3963:3967], and AgHarvestReadinessAssessor [3967:3971]. Cross-domain: this machine bridges the Agriculture and AI domains." ;
